      "source_text": "自己出演了广告的大型电视机取得了大畅销！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e03c78f340dd58e4114851b4e6bc48cc1b64a19a871cda91a65c755937d5b66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7f9b8eb313551fc7ed55551",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "从未在塔酱身上留下伤痕",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba195c9f77ae217dc2418da42a8218c6aea7e6a6a0fe43b4a24779a618a7a1c0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33725da76b893441c0503424",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "观看过的舞台剧小册子收藏",
      "source_fingerprint": "60ccc4efa751e054d90120d660484b63bc033a97e0c1844c69197f5b6de9f4ec",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f8f7f4732c6f9e488b8778ca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "很容易受到周围人照顾",
      "source_fingerprint": "91971e3f5cf573e3d7232e1a0744af6cd76305081b07dc11880d64e7818b421e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a54fe9f3b0f8d5705c6ee072",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "模仿才能",
      "source_fingerprint": "6043e9e4fc434a98bae217a10b9cd50c40431ef5766e4849cd2c9a982cf02ffb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ed7d304d8a85059fae9593f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在老家的牧场里，很受羊群的喜欢",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d5af894f0865a142a95086f716a0de42b6ffabac96d583fbccfbf468b6a252b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eead62649b720805b430049",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "现在能用龙笛吹奏Live曲目了",
      "source_fingerprint": "653302e10bba9601fc56729a679993739cc5f1c1e069f70d430c22f26a8144f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc6b7ecda2c70c8849248b83",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "看到别人的奇怪行为不会再像以前一样大惊小怪了",
      "source_fingerprint": "f089464e758a61b353be4c9962038b8000ee1f7dab664ef77d6fcdff18d78a84",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "262",
        "1013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e8021a9bdcb3555013d1cb6f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "自己拍摄的各地拉面店招牌暖帘的照片",
